1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:09.99,Warning,,0,0,0,,Medya oynatıcınız bu bölümde kullanılan altyazı formatını desteklemiyor. Altyazılar muhtemelen düzgün çalıxmayacaktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:41.85,Warning,,0,0,0,,Medya oynatıcınız bu bölümde kullanılan altyazı formatını desteklemiyor. Altyazılar muhtemelen düzgün çalıxmayacaktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:01:35.87,0:01:37.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neler oluyor burada?!Dialogue: 50,0:01:37.99,0:01:40.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy'nin grubu burada ne arıyor?!Dialogue: 50,0:01:40.29,0:01:44.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ayrıca Law da hapishanede olmalıydı!Dialogue: 50,0:01:45.04,0:01:47.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni hemen bırak, Kanjuro!Dialogue: 50,0:01:48.30,0:01:53.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon'un planını harfi harfine Orochi-sama'ya rapor ettim!Dialogue: 50,0:01:54.30,0:01:58.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu konuda hiçbir xey yapmamıx olamaz!Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.68,0:02:02.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerçekten Sunny'nin sıradan bir bombaya yenilecexini mi sandınız?Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.85,0:02:04.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizi ahmaklar!Dialogue: 50,0:02:04.52,0:02:07.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bin denizi yara yara...Dialogue: 50,0:02:07.82,0:02:11.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ilerleyecek olan Thousand Sunny, kökenini kıymetli Adem Axacı'ndan alır!Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.74,0:02:11.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ilerleyecek olan Thousand Sunny, kökenini kıymetli Adem Axacı'ndan alır!Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.78,0:02:11.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ilerleyecek olan Thousand Sunny, kökenini kıymetli Adem Axacı'ndan alır!Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.82,0:02:11.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ilerleyecek olan Thousand Sunny, kökenini kıymetli Adem Axacı'ndan alır!Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.86,0:02:11.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ilerleyecek olan Thousand Sunny, kökenini kıymetli Adem Axacı'ndan alır!Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.90,0:02:11.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ilerleyecek olan Thousand Sunny, kökenini kıymetli Adem Axacı'ndan alır!Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.94,0:02:11.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ilerleyecek olan Thousand Sunny, kökenini kıymetli Adem Axacı'ndan alır!Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.99,0:02:12.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ilerleyecek olan Thousand Sunny, kökenini kıymetli Adem Axacı'ndan alır!Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.03,0:02:12.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ilerleyecek olan Thousand Sunny, kökenini kıymetli Adem Axacı'ndan alır!Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.07,0:02:12.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ilerleyecek olan Thousand Sunny, kökenini kıymetli Adem Axacı'ndan alır!Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.11,0:02:12.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ilerleyecek olan Thousand Sunny, kökenini kıymetli Adem Axacı'ndan alır!Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.45,0:02:16.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O zavallı patlamanın bu gemiyi yok etmesi imkânsız!Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.91,0:02:19.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İxe yaramadı mı demek istiyorsun?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.33,0:02:22.66,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,Elbette yaramadı! Tek bir çizik bile atamadınız!Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.29,0:02:26.46,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,Gerçi yelkenleri yandı ama...Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.76,0:02:32.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kusura bakma, Kin'emon!Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.76,0:02:35.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yelkeni onarması biraz sürdü de!Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.55,0:02:36.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlıyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.93,0:02:38.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek bu yüzden geciktiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.85,0:02:40.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kin!Dialogue: 50,0:02:41.47,0:02:44.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha kalabalık olmanız gerekmiyor muydu?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.19,0:02:47.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beklediximden daha azsınız.Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.69,0:02:50.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neyse, xu gemileri batıracaxım, tamam mı?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.07,0:02:52.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kesinlikle.Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.19,0:02:55.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok daha fazla müttefik görmeyi bekliyorduk.Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.95,0:03:00.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tutsak madenindeki 3.500 mahkûma ne oldu?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.33,0:03:02.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, onları göremiyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.62,0:03:06.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sefirler, yakuzalar'ı toplamak için farklı bölgelere seyahat ettiler...Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.12,0:03:09.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,200'den fazla olmalılar.Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.29,0:03:13.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Itachi Limanı'nda Inuarashi'nin 200 Silahxoru...Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.84,0:03:17.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ve Atama Daxı Hırsızları'ndan 280 kixi vardı!Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.84,0:03:22.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Herkesin bizimle, onardıxımız gemileriyle burada buluxması gerekiyordu!Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.43,0:03:26.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sstelik herkese yetecek kadar büyük bir silah sevkiyatı da...Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.64,0:03:29.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ringo"dan buraya ulaxmıx olmalıydı!Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.69,0:03:31.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kin'emon!Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.73,0:03:33.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir sorun mu oldu?Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.33,0:03:48.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bendeniz... büyük bir hata yaptım.Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.38,0:03:52.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy-dono, çok üzgünüm!Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.09,0:03:56.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yaptıxımız plan tümüyle sızdı...Dialogue: 50,0:03:58.13,0:04:01.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dixerlerinin baxına ne geldixini bilmiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.14,0:04:04.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek bu yüzden kimse yok!Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.22,0:04:06.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yani bu savaxta yalnız mıyız?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.39,0:04:08.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?! Olamaz!Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.98,0:04:11.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizler neler olduxunu biliyoruz!Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.52,0:04:14.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aslanlı gemiyi batırmakta baxarısız olmux olabiliriz...Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.90,0:04:19.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama dün gece limana demir atmıx tüm gemileri batırmayı baxardık!Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.70,0:04:22.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orochi-sama titiz bir adamdır.Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.74,0:04:26.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bize bölgeleri birbirine baxlayan ana köprülerin hepsini yıkma emri verdi!Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.75,0:04:29.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi çaktınız mı?Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.58,0:04:33.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizi kurtarmaya kimse gelmeyecek!Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.00,0:04:38.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buraya gelseler bile, gemileri olmadan Onigashima'ya varamayacaklar!Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.42,0:04:42.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ayrıca bu fırsatı kaçırırsanız, bir daha denemek için xansınız olmayacak!Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.47,0:04:47.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dıxarı saldıxımız tüm isyancıları yarın birer birer öldürmeye baxlayacaxız!Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.94,0:04:52.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ayrıca henüz bahsetmediximiz bir konu daha var!Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.44,0:04:53.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kusura bakmayın.Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.94,0:04:56.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizi daha fazla umutsuzluxa sürüklemek istemezdik...Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.53,0:04:58.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.07,0:05:03.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bugünkü ziyafet, sıradan bir Atex Festivali xöleni dexil...Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.87,0:05:06.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu ziyafet, Canavar Korsanları ile...Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.24,0:05:11.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ünlü Big Mom Korsanları arasındaki ittifakın kutlamasıdır!Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.13,0:05:15.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido ve Big Mom mı?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.17,0:05:17.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İki Yonko'nun ittifakı mı?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.21,0:05:21.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hem Kaptan Kaido hem de Big Mom bizim tarafımızda!Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.22,0:05:23.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böylesi bir güçle nasıl bax edebilirler?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.97,0:05:26.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,En Kötü Nesil mi?! Onlar bir hiç!Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.76,0:05:30.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haydi hepsini batırıp xu ixi bitirelim!Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.48,0:05:31.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Atexe hazır olun!Dialogue: 50,0:05:39.40,0:05:41.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne bu kibirli tavırlar?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.03,0:05:44.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeterince duydum.Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.53,0:05:45.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Herkes, geride dursun.Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.24,0:05:47.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Embesil...Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.49,0:05:48.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen geride dur!Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.12,0:05:49.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yapıyorsun, Tra-o?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.20,0:05:49.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yapıyorsun, Tra-o?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.29,0:05:50.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yapıyorsun, Tra-o?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.79,0:05:53.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hallederim dedim ya!Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.17,0:05:54.38,Main-207+,,0,125,0,,Sanki halledebilirsin de!Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.38,0:05:57.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, asıl siz ikiniz geri çekilin!Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.04,0:05:58.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben hallederim!Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.75,0:06:00.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hassiktir, Dikenli!Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.88,0:06:02.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kapa' çeneni!Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.72,0:06:02.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sözümü dinleyin, gerzekler!Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.80,0:06:02.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sözümü dinleyin, gerzekler!Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.88,0:06:04.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sözümü dinleyin, gerzekler!Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.84,0:06:05.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,f be!Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.89,0:06:07.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oraya ilk varan kazanır!Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.39,0:06:08.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni xerefsiz!Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.97,0:06:10.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İlk varan ben olacaxım!Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.98,0:06:12.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anca rüyanda!Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.27,0:06:19.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tra-o!Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.32,0:06:20.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lanet olası...Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.53,0:06:22.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu yaxmurda "Oda"mın hızına erixemezsiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.99,0:06:26.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buna hile denir! Yetenexin adil dexil!Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.87,0:06:27.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kimin umurunda?Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.87,0:06:30.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şovmenin tekisin!Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.16,0:06:31.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu konuxana da bak.Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.75,0:06:33.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Defolun!Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.29,0:06:35.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tek bir darbe ile hepsini indirebilirim!Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.33,0:06:39.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yani benim tek bir darbede indiremeyeceximi mi söylüyorsun?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:40.38,0:06:41.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben yapacaxım.Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.51,0:06:43.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siz ikiniz tam bir eziksiniz.Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.55,0:06:44.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İtirazı olan?Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.97,0:06:46.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Ezik mi?!  Ezik mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.64,0:06:48.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen kime ezik diyorsun?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.26,0:06:50.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben kimseye yenilmem!Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.31,0:06:51.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoluma çıkmayın!Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.77,0:06:55.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,B-Buradan canlı çıkmayı düxünmüyorsunuz herhâlde!Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.23,0:06:57.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Havlamayı kesin, sizi salyalılar!Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.40,0:06:59.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlarla ben ilgilenecexim!Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.57,0:07:00.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kes sesini!Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.65,0:07:01.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Görecexiz!Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.82,0:07:07.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oda!Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.61,0:07:41.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sıçrayan Adam!Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.32,0:07:50.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Punk Rotten!Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.09,0:08:02.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enjeksiyon Vuruxu!Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.75,0:08:37.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, gördün mü?Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.12,0:08:39.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kimmix ezik bakalım?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.54,0:08:41.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir xeyi açıklıxa kavuxturalım.Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.21,0:08:44.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gemiyi batıran bendim.Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.92,0:08:46.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kör müsün sen?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.34,0:08:48.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saçmalamayı kesin!Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.55,0:08:50.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Batıran bendim!Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.47,0:08:53.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onların müttefik olduxunu sanıyordum...Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.89,0:08:58.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O...?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.73,0:09:02.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kyoshiro Ailesi'nin gemisi!Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.81,0:09:05.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kyoshiro geldi!Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.07,0:09:07.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Artık güvendeyiz!Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.53,0:09:09.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baxınız biraz belada sanki.Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.86,0:09:15.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orochi-sama'nın emrettixi gibi Kızıl Kınları batırmalıydık ama...Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.58,0:09:16.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pekâlâ.Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.62,0:09:18.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Düxmanı batıralım mı diyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.91,0:09:20.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hallederiz!Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.88,0:09:27.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yapıyorsunuz, Patron!Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.22,0:09:36.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizi batırmaya gerek yok.Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.22,0:09:40.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O yüzden sadece bu tarafa dönük toplarınızı kestim.Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.31,0:09:42.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu herif... onu hatırlıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:09:42.81,0:09:45.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dikkat edin! İyi bir kılıç ustasıdır!Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.82,0:09:48.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şogun'un köpexi!Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.07,0:09:51.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Patron Hyogoro'nun yerini alan bir yakuza o!Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.74,0:09:56.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kızıl Kın samurayları!Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.45,0:10:00.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bendeniz !içek Baxkenti'nden bir yakuzayım!Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.70,0:10:03.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İnsanlar bana Pinekleyen Kyoshiro der!Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.87,0:10:09.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kyoshiro Ailesi, 200 kixilik bir kuvvet! Lütfen size katılmamıza izin verin!Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.38,0:10:11.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Ne?!  Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.55,0:10:13.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dalga mı geçiyorsun, Patron?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.09,0:10:14.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu da ne demek ximdi?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.51,0:10:16.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen Orochi'nin adamısın!Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.14,0:10:18.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bize yardım etme yükümlülüxün nedir?Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.27,0:10:26.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Hanesi'ne olan baxlılıxım ve minnettarlıxım tarif edilemez⬦Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.23,0:10:31.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,zellikle de seni hiç unutamıyorum, Kin-san!Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.86,0:10:34.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin-san mı?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.11,0:10:38.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,40 yıl önce, Dax Tanrısı Olayı baxkenti sarsmıxtı!Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.91,0:10:45.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Halk bunun için Oden-san'ı suçlamıxtı...Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.17,0:10:47.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama yanıldılar.Dialogue: 50,0:10:47.92,0:10:54.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Asıl suçlu, küçük bir domuzu satmaya çalıxan açgözlü bir genç olan sendin!Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.22,0:11:00.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.39,0:11:03.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu hikâyeyi bilebilecek sadece tek kixi tanıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.44,0:11:08.27,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu yüzden ona Dax Tanrısı deniyor!Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.27,0:11:09.48,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.48,0:11:11.40,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Olamaz!Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.40,0:11:13.90,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunun sorumlusu benim!Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.82,0:11:16.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoksa...?Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.45,0:11:18.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen misin, Denjiro?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.95,0:11:19.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.58,0:11:20.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Denjiro-san mı?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.29,0:11:28.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok doxru!Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.08,0:11:29.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanırım beni tanıyamadınız...Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.96,0:11:33.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizi gördüxüm gibi kendimi tanıtmak istedim,Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.51,0:11:36.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,fakat her ihtimale karxı düxman olarak kaldım.Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.88,0:11:39.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Görünüxe göre, kimliximi açık etseymixim...Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.76,0:11:44.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orochi'nin casusu tarafından açıxa çıkarılır ve öldürülürdüm!Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.35,0:11:47.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Denjiro!Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.60,0:11:49.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sus!Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.40,0:11:53.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,En sonuna kadar, Orochi'nin güvenini elimde tuttuxum için...Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.19,0:11:58.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rasetsu Hapishanesi'ndeki 1.000 samurayı kurtarma xansı yakaladım!Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.07,0:11:59.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şuraya bakın!Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.24,0:12:00.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Düxman birlikleri mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.03,0:12:04.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Toplamda 1.200 kixiyiz!Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.16,0:12:06.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Size katılmamıza izin verin!Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.29,0:12:14.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Artık zamanı geldi!Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.21,0:12:16.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sonunda savaxabilecexiz!Dialogue: 50,0:12:16.01,0:12:20.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,P-Patron Kyoshiro, Dokuz Kızıl Kın'dan biri miymix?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.51,0:12:23.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Derhal Onigashima'ya haber edin!Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.01,0:12:24.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hemen!Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.40,0:12:32.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Denjiro...Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.27,0:12:34.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ayrıca Kin-san!Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.57,0:12:35.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha?Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.15,0:12:37.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zeki bir adam olduxunu biliyordum!Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.82,0:12:42.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu sembol büyük savaxın tarihini ve buluxma noktasını ifade ediyor!Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.28,0:12:44.66,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Engerexin üzerinde⬦Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.24,0:12:47.00,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,yanan iki kux...Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.00,0:12:51.13,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,ve isyan anlamına gelen ters hilal!Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.13,0:12:54.84,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,"Atex Festivali günü. Akxam alacasında. Kuxun ikinci saati.Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.84,0:12:57.26,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Habu Limanında."Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.26,0:13:00.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orijinal sembolde bu iki çizgi yoktu.Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.76,0:13:05.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu broxür Orochi'ye sızdırıldı...Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.52,0:13:11.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ama Yasuie-sama, ölmeden önce sembolü dexixtirdi!Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.73,0:13:14.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeni eklenen bu iki çizgi...Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.40,0:13:18.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ortadaki harfleri kaldırıyor!Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.36,0:13:23.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yani orta kısmı olmayan "Habuminato"  yeni buluxma noktası anlamına gelen...Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.53,0:13:24.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Hato" oluyor!Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.20,0:13:29.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yani Yasuie-sama'nın sevdixi...Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.96,0:13:33.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,akçaaxaç ormanının harika manzarasına sahip olan Habu Limanı rıhtımı.Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.46,0:13:36.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.05,0:13:37.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.92,0:13:43.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Engerexin üstündeki iki çizgiyi gören herkes bu mesajı kolayca anlardı.Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.47,0:13:49.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama Orochi'nin casusunun aranızda olduxunu anlayıp...Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.52,0:13:54.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,limanı bilerek "tokage" diye yanlıx okudun!Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.19,0:14:00.03,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'nun her limanı adını bir hayvandan alır.Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.03,0:14:04.45,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Biraz uzun olsa da bir yılana bacak eklersen kertenkele olur.Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.45,0:14:06.99,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Udon'daki Togake Limanı.Dialogue: 50,0:14:08.87,0:14:13.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doxru... o resim kertenkeleye benzemiyordu.Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.29,0:14:17.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ona güvendim çünkü Kin-san kendinden hep çok emindir.Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.34,0:14:20.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Casus, tuzaxına düxüp...Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.01,0:14:24.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orochi'ye Tokage Limanı'nın yeni buluxma noktası olduxunu söyledi!Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.60,0:14:30.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu da sadece baxkentte duran bir zalimin ahmaklıxıdır!Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.35,0:14:35.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orochi bölgeler arasındaki mesafeyi yanlıx hesaplayıp dün geceye kadar box oturdu!Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.65,0:14:40.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O zamana kadar tüm müttefikleriniz köprüleri geçmixti...Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.94,0:14:43.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ve ihtiyacınız olan bütün gemiler de limandan ayrılmıxtı!Dialogue: 50,0:14:43.95,0:14:46.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sadece arta kalan gemiler yok edildi!Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.66,0:14:50.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tam da planladıxın gibi, 4.200 askerin hepsi...Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.29,0:14:55.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Habu Limanı rıhtımında zamanı gelene kadar gizlice beklediler!Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.08,0:14:58.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yani herkes güvende mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.52,0:15:18.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yirmi yıl geçmesine raxmen, Oden-sama'nın o efsanevi ölümünü hâlâ unutamıyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.86,0:15:22.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Hanesi'nin geri dönecexine inanarak yaxadık hayatımızı!Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.03,0:15:26.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizinleyiz, Kızıl Kın samurayları!Dialogue: 50,0:15:26.36,0:15:28.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her xey hazır!Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.08,0:15:35.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onigashima Baskını, tam da planlandıxı gibi olacak!Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.67,0:15:41.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,1.200 kixiyi de eklersek toplamda 5.400 kixi oluyoruz!Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.04,0:15:43.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haydi gidelim!Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.01,0:15:49.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İstikamet Onigashima!Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.10,0:15:54.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şuna bakın!Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.35,0:16:00.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tam olarak ne olduxunu anlayamadım ama sanırım xu an her xey yolunda!Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.02,0:16:01.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok fazlalar!Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.82,0:16:04.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mahvolduk!Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.11,0:16:05.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onigashima'dan haber var mı?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.99,0:16:10.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Arıyorum ama kimse açmıyor! Muhtemelen ziyafetle mexguller!Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.03,0:16:12.41,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne büyük felaket!Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.41,0:16:14.83,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Hiçbir xeyi engelleyememixiz!Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.83,0:16:18.08,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahrolası, Kin'emon!Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.75,0:16:20.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin-san!Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.08,0:16:22.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen gerçekten bizim liderimizsin!Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.29,0:16:24.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ve bekledixim gibi, saygımı hak eden bir adamsın!Dialogue: 50,0:16:38.44,0:16:40.44,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Demek tokage limanı dexil...Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.10,0:16:43.11,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,asıl mekan rıhtımmıx...Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.10,0:16:43.11,Note-207+,,0,0,0,,(Hato)Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.87,0:16:55.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dürüst ol, Kin'emon.Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.83,0:17:00.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Senin böyle bir plan yapamayacaxını hepimiz biliyoruz.Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.67,0:17:03.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Artık her xey yolunda.Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.17,0:17:04.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kızmayacaxız, itiraf et.Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.80,0:17:05.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durun.Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.05,0:17:09.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerçekten tokage sandın, dexil mi?Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.30,0:17:10.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durun dedim!Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.59,0:17:12.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sonuçta, her xey yoluna girdi!Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.72,0:17:14.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şansın yaver gitti.Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.31,0:17:20.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu savax, bendenizin son savaxı olabilir.Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.02,0:17:25.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanırım hayatımın en büyük xansını kullanmıx oldum.Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.23,0:17:29.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hakikaten xeytan tüyü varmıx sende!Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.61,0:17:31.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon-dono!Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.03,0:17:32.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Canımız liderimiz!Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.78,0:17:38.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O hâlde biz de tüm xansımızı kullanmıx olduk, ne de olsa aynı amacı paylaxıyoruz!Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.62,0:17:44.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu doxru, Kin-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.33,0:17:46.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yalnız ölmene izin vermeyecexiz!Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.50,0:17:49.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Samurayları olarak Oden-sama'ya birlikte hizmet ettik!Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.21,0:17:53.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Farklı yollardan gelsek de son direniximizde tek yürexiz! İyi belle bunu!Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.35,0:18:06.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizin gibi serserilerin tesellisi ancak bu kadar olur.Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.98,0:18:10.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaldır kılıcını, Kin-san!Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.99,0:18:13.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İlk taarruzu çoktan kazandık!Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.95,0:18:21.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaderimize kucak açalım!Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.41,0:18:25.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama'nın intikamını birlikte alacaxız!Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.79,0:18:29.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon-dono!Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.05,0:18:32.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne pahası olursa olsun, Wano'ya dexiximi getirecexiz!Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.43,0:18:39.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geberesice Kin'emon...Dialogue: 50,0:18:39.22,0:18:40.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onigashima'ya rapor vermem gerek.Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.97,0:18:44.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orochi-sama'nın bana biçtixi rolü layıkıyla tamamladım!Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.02,0:18:48.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yapacak sadece tek bir xey kaldı!Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.49,0:18:57.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İzin vermem!Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.41,0:19:01.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama'yı almana izin vermeyecexim!Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.17,0:19:08.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu! Bekle, geliyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.34,0:19:10.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yapma! Boxulursun!Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.71,0:19:15.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayallerimizi çixneyip bizi umutsuzluxa sürüklemekten zevk mi alıyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.22,0:19:17.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kanjuro!Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.51,0:19:21.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet! Hayatımın en güzel günlerini yaxıyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.35,0:19:25.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aldatmaca, ihanet ve ardından sürpriz son!Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.35,0:19:28.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dünyada bundan daha iyi bir oyun yok!Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.94,0:19:33.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ve hepiniz de yardakçıyı mükemmel oynadınız!Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.61,0:19:39.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kanjuro!Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.08,0:19:48.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finalde sahne Kozuki kanıyla kırmızıya boyanacak!Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.47,0:19:57.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu!Dialogue: 50,0:19:57.30,0:19:59.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.55,0:20:01.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Endixelenme, Momonosuke.Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.30,0:20:04.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kız kardexini de seninle ölüme gönderecexim.Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.06,0:20:05.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu!Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.31,0:20:08.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yemin olsun ki Hiyori'yi bulup onu da öldürecexim!Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.27,0:20:10.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onun hayatta olduxunu biliyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.40,0:20:15.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kanjuro!Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.99,0:20:19.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne zamandan beri bu kadar iyi uçabilen bir kux çizebiliyorsun?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:19.16,0:20:25.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Senden gördüxümüz tek xey ıslanınca silinen berbat karalamalardı!Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.00,0:20:27.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok yüksek!Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.33,0:20:28.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İndir beni!Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.92,0:20:29.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok korkuyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.79,0:20:31.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kimse yok mu?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.67,0:20:32.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kanjuro?Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.79,0:20:33.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo?Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.84,0:20:35.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Nereye gidiyorsunuz?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.51,0:20:37.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hoxça kalın, aptallar!Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.18,0:20:45.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yaparsanız yapın, Kaido-sama'nın ordusunu yenemezsiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.43,0:20:48.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adaya adım bile atamayacaksınız!Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.94,0:20:56.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yardım edin!Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.86,0:20:58.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekle!Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.24,0:20:59.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.91,0:21:02.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kızıl Kınlar'dan Kanjuro bize ihanet etti!Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.70,0:21:04.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.62,0:21:05.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neden?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:08.21,0:21:12.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yani casus Kanjuro muymux, Robin-chan?Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.79,0:21:14.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,yle görünüyor.Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.17,0:21:15.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo-chan'a yardım etmeliyiz!Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.75,0:21:17.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.26,0:21:25.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.85,0:21:29.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kanjuro, düxman casusuymux!Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.10,0:21:31.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo'yu kaçırıyor!Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.60,0:21:32.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.52,0:21:34.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Emin misin?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.02,0:21:37.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunca zamandır bize yalan mı söyledi?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.86,0:21:40.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şerefsiz!Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.95,0:21:46.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bulutlara doxru uçuyor!Dialogue: 50,0:21:47.24,0:21:48.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onu indirecexim!Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.25,0:21:54.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,lümcül Yexil Yıldız: !ınar Şuriken!Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.22,0:22:03.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Szgünüm ama...Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.26,0:22:06.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,siz amatörlere ayıracak vaktim yok!Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.07,0:22:19.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu bulut da ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.94,0:22:21.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yapma, Sanji-dono!Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.61,0:22:22.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geri gel!Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.95,0:22:24.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İçimde kötü bir his var!Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.70,0:22:29.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eminim daha önce hiç  görmediximiz bir teknik...Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.41,0:22:31.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mürekkep Bulutu!Dialogue: 50,0:22:35.29,0:22:37.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mürekkep oklar, yaxmur gibi yaxın!Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.51,0:22:49.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ukiyo Portresi: Akxam Duxu!Dialogue: 50,0:22:55.98,0:22:57.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dümeni çevir!Dialogue: 50,0:22:57.31,0:22:59.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buluttan uzak durun!Dialogue: 50,0:23:02.86,0:23:03.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır!Dialogue: 50,0:23:03.78,0:23:05.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami-san!Dialogue: 50,0:23:08.58,0:23:12.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami ve Robin'in kalbine ok atacak tek kixi...Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.79,0:23:15.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,benim!Dialogue: 50,0:23:15.87,0:23:17.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!Dialogue: 50,0:23:19.75,0:23:22.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dur artık, Kanjuro!Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.88,0:23:26.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepsi ölecek!Dialogue: 50,0:23:26.34,0:23:27.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok doxru...Dialogue: 50,0:23:28.22,0:23:30.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepsi ölecek...Dialogue: 50,0:23:31.18,0:23:32.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,önünde sonunda!Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.31,0:23:36.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baban Oden...Dialogue: 50,0:23:37.27,0:23:40.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ve annen Toki'nin o box umudu,Dialogue: 50,0:23:41.15,0:23:45.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,o aptalların ölümünü sadece 20 yıl geciktirdi!Dialogue: 50,0:23:49.91,0:23:56.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu öfkeli ve intikam dolu samurayların baxındaki kixinin,Dialogue: 50,0:23:56.92,0:24:02.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,yüksekten korkan bir ödlek olması ne kadar da ironik.Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.26,0:24:10.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tam bir komedi!Dialogue: 50,0:24:11.10,0:24:13.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biliyorum...Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.98,0:24:19.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben Kozuki Oden dexilim...Dialogue: 50,0:24:19.98,0:24:22.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu herkesten daha iyi biliyorum...Dialogue: 50,0:24:27.32,0:24:28.82,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yapmalıyım?!Dialogue: 50,0:24:28.82,0:24:29.91,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Hiçbir xey...Dialogue: 50,0:24:31.53,0:24:32.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,M...Dialogue: 50,0:24:32.99,0:24:34.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mi...Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.87,0:24:38.04,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne demeye çalıxıyorum?Dialogue: 50,0:24:38.83,0:24:42.75,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,yle bir xey söylersem kimse bana yardım etmeyecek!Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.21,0:24:45.30,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama...Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.18,0:24:53.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Millet!Dialogue: 50,0:24:53.89,0:24:59.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni duyabiliyor musunuz?!Dialogue: 50,0:24:59.73,0:25:01.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:25:02.23,0:25:06.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepiniz dinleyin, benim için endixelenmeyin!Dialogue: 50,0:25:07.69,0:25:11.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İstedikleri tam olarak bu!Dialogue: 50,0:25:12.99,0:25:16.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendi baxımın çaresine bakarım!Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.79,0:25:23.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'yla Orochi'yi devirip Wano'yu kurtarmanız için size sesleniyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:25:28.84,0:25:33.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sözleri öylesine asil ve dokunaklı ki!Dialogue: 50,0:25:34.18,0:25:35.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:25:38.02,0:25:40.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:25:40.73,0:25:44.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bizim bücür Momo, sonunda bir erkek gibi ayaklandı!Dialogue: 50,0:25:46.90,0:25:48.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok doxru, Momo!Dialogue: 50,0:25:50.03,0:25:51.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen...Dialogue: 50,0:25:51.95,0:25:55.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,korkak ve aptal bir velet olabilirsin...Dialogue: 50,0:25:55.37,0:25:59.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ama yüksekten atmayı iyi beceriyorsun, seni topuzlu bücür!Dialogue: 50,0:25:59.08,0:26:02.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama'yla öyle konuxmaya nasıl cüret ediyor?!Dialogue: 50,0:26:02.08,0:26:03.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kim o xerefsiz?!Dialogue: 50,0:26:03.42,0:26:04.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doxrayın onu!Dialogue: 50,0:26:05.54,0:26:07.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayatta kal!Dialogue: 50,0:26:07.75,0:26:11.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni kesinlikle kurtaracaxım!Dialogue: 50,0:26:15.05,0:26:16.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ünkü biz dostuz!Dialogue: 50,0:26:40.41,0:26:41.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pekâlâ...Dialogue: 50,0:26:44.58,0:26:46.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gidelim, Onigashima'ya!Dialogue: 50,0:26:46.79,0:26:48.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Evet!  Evet!Dialogue: 50,0:27:04.60,0:27:05.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:27:05.98,0:27:08.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir düxman gemisi kaçıyor!Dialogue: 50,0:27:10.28,0:27:11.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aldırma.Dialogue: 50,0:27:11.48,0:27:15.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biz de zaten o yöne gidiyoruz, onu sonra batırırız.Dialogue: 50,0:27:16.70,0:27:19.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?! Bir gemi daha var sanıyordum.Dialogue: 50,0:27:19.53,0:27:21.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doxrudur, onu çoktan batırdım.Dialogue: 50,0:27:24.04,0:27:27.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin-sama! Kusura bakma.Dialogue: 50,0:27:27.04,0:27:29.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onu kurtarmam gerekirdi.Dialogue: 50,0:27:29.17,0:27:31.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi olmana sevindim.Dialogue: 50,0:27:31.13,0:27:34.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Henüz Momonosuke-sama'ya kıyacaklarını sanmıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:27:34.76,0:27:37.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu arada, Denjiro!Dialogue: 50,0:27:37.01,0:27:38.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Senin...Dialogue: 50,0:27:39.05,0:27:40.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,yüzüne ne oldu?!Dialogue: 50,0:27:43.85,0:27:45.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uzun hikâye.Dialogue: 50,0:27:47.98,0:27:50.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizleri gördüxüme çok sevindim!Dialogue: 50,0:27:50.19,0:27:52.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Millet!Dialogue: 50,0:27:52.11,0:27:53.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi misiniz?!Dialogue: 50,0:27:53.36,0:27:57.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Birkaç yaralı ve enkaza dönmüx gemiler var!Dialogue: 50,0:27:57.53,0:27:59.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi gidip adaya ayak basalım!Dialogue: 50,0:27:59.95,0:28:03.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Denizde ölmeyi hiç istemeyiz!Dialogue: 50,0:28:03.58,0:28:04.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:28:06.04,0:28:09.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burası samuray bakımevi dexil!Dialogue: 50,0:28:12.75,0:28:13.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Size emanetiz.  Size emanetiz.Dialogue: 50,0:28:14.96,0:28:16.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, dexilsiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:28:16.67,0:28:17.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İnin!Dialogue: 50,0:28:18.51,0:28:19.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ocuklar!Dialogue: 50,0:28:20.43,0:28:22.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapkalar'ın arkasında kalmayın!Dialogue: 50,0:28:22.93,0:28:24.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Evet!  Evet!Dialogue: 50,0:28:30.61,0:28:32.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O da neydi?! Nereden geldi?!Dialogue: 50,0:28:34.82,0:28:36.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu kaçan gemiden!Dialogue: 50,0:28:38.49,0:28:40.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uzun menzilli top mu?!Dialogue: 50,0:28:40.03,0:28:43.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sadece mesafeyi koruyorlarmıx!Dialogue: 50,0:28:43.08,0:28:45.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O kadar uzaktan bizi nasıl vurabiliyorlar?!Dialogue: 50,0:28:50.88,0:28:54.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano silahları dünyada bir numaradır!Dialogue: 50,0:28:55.17,0:29:03.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'nun fabrikaları sayesinde devasa bir silah deposuna sahibiz!Dialogue: 50,0:29:03.51,0:29:08.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sıkıyorsa yine deminki gibi üzerimize uçun!Dialogue: 50,0:29:13.65,0:29:14.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geri basın!Dialogue: 50,0:29:14.86,0:29:16.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok yakınız!Dialogue: 50,0:29:27.83,0:29:31.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin! Pozisyon almaya çalıxtıkları belliydi...Dialogue: 50,0:29:33.58,0:29:35.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tam yol ileri!Dialogue: 50,0:29:35.30,0:29:36.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yaklaxmamız gerek!Dialogue: 50,0:29:40.22,0:29:44.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaç samuray gemisi batırdıkları umurumda bile dexil!Dialogue: 50,0:29:51.69,0:29:52.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eyvah!Dialogue: 50,0:29:52.69,0:29:54.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu xekilde mesafeyi korurlarsa...Dialogue: 50,0:29:56.07,0:29:58.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,hepimiz denizin dibini boylayacaxız!Dialogue: 50,0:30:05.03,0:30:06.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Artık bitti!Dialogue: 50,0:30:07.45,0:30:10.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yapabilecekleri bir xey kalmadı!Dialogue: 50,0:30:20.67,0:30:22.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Atex! Atex!Dialogue: 50,0:30:27.31,0:30:30.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Balıkadam Karatesi:Dialogue: 50,0:30:30.89,0:30:34.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mızrak Dalgası!Dialogue: 50,0:30:52.25,0:30:53.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gövde yarıldı!Dialogue: 50,0:30:53.29,0:30:54.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yardım edin!Dialogue: 50,0:30:54.37,0:30:55.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Düxüyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:31:01.17,0:31:04.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Balıkadam Karatesi:Dialogue: 50,0:31:04.38,0:31:08.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mızrak Dalgalı Yaxmur Banyosu!Dialogue: 50,0:31:19.44,0:31:21.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uzun menzilli toplar...Dialogue: 50,0:31:25.24,0:31:27.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir xeyler oluyor.Dialogue: 50,0:31:27.45,0:31:29.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Belki de boxularak ölen bir bebexin hayaleti...Dialogue: 50,0:31:30.45,0:31:32.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,onları öldürüyordur.Dialogue: 50,0:31:32.95,0:31:35.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu anda bu dedixin bile kulaxa çok tatlı geliyor!Dialogue: 50,0:31:35.96,0:31:37.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neler oluyor orada?!Dialogue: 50,0:31:46.88,0:31:48.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kim var orada?Dialogue: 50,0:31:50.76,0:31:52.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Millet!Dialogue: 50,0:31:53.14,0:31:55.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir saniyelixine beni dinleyin...Dialogue: 50,0:31:58.77,0:32:01.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Denizin dibinde olan...Dialogue: 50,0:32:01.90,0:32:07.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ryugu Krallıxı'nın Balıkadam Bölgesi'nde doxdum.Dialogue: 50,0:32:09.99,0:32:15.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hizmet ettixim herkese büyük sıkıntılar yaxattım.Dialogue: 50,0:32:16.33,0:32:22.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi, tayfanın en yeni üyesi olarak Patron Hasır Şapka-san'ın...Dialogue: 50,0:32:22.96,0:32:25.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,sake kadehini yudumluyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:32:30.51,0:32:32.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Herkes bana...Dialogue: 50,0:32:32.60,0:32:36.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Denizin Şövalyesi, Jinbe der!Dialogue: 50,0:32:39.19,0:32:40.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şaka olmalı!Dialogue: 50,0:32:40.77,0:32:43.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapkalar'a mı katılacaksın?!Dialogue: 50,0:32:45.49,0:32:48.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendimi alçakgönüllülükle tanıtıyorum...Dialogue: 50,0:32:48.95,0:32:52.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ve uyumlu kardexliximizi dört gözle bekliyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:32:59.25,0:33:01.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Jinbe-san!  Jinbe!Dialogue: 50,0:33:01.13,0:33:02.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Patron!  Patron!Dialogue: 50,0:33:02.42,0:33:04.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Jinbe!  Jinbe!Dialogue: 50,0:33:06.80,0:33:10.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni hoxgörüyle karxıladıxınız için texekkürler!Dialogue: 50,0:33:10.80,0:33:11.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:33:11.93,0:33:14.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sana söz verdixim gibi sax salim döndüm!Dialogue: 50,0:33:15.26,0:33:18.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Savaxa yetixebildixime sevindim!Dialogue: 2,0:01:38.04,0:01:40.29,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon'un Zekice PlanıDialogue: 1,0:01:38.04,0:01:40.29,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon'un Zekice PlanıDialogue: 0,0:13:18.36,0:13:23.53,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,HabuminatoDialogue: 0,0:13:22.70,0:13:22.78,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,/Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.78,0:13:22.87,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,/Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.87,0:13:23.53,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,/Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.95,0:13:23.03,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,/Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.03,0:13:23.53,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,/Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.53,0:13:23.57,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,HatoDialogue: 0,0:13:23.57,0:13:23.61,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,HatoDialogue: 0,0:13:23.61,0:13:23.65,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,HatoDialogue: 0,0:13:23.65,0:13:23.69,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,HatoDialogue: 0,0:13:23.69,0:13:23.74,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,HatoDialogue: 0,0:13:23.74,0:13:23.78,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,HatoDialogue: 0,0:13:23.78,0:13:23.82,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,HatoDialogue: 0,0:13:23.82,0:13:24.99,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,HatoDialogue: 0,0:13:24.58,0:13:26.54,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,RıhtımDialogue: 0,0:13:26.54,0:13:26.58,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,RıhtımDialogue: 0,0:13:26.58,0:13:26.62,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,RıhtımDialogue: 0,0:13:24.58,0:13:26.54,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,(Hato)Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.54,0:13:26.58,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,(Hato)Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.58,0:13:26.62,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,(Hato)Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.62,0:13:26.66,Captions-207+,,